  "text": "This new AI update marks the end of manual database architecture for non-technical founders. Non-technical creators spend days trying to connect primary keys, foreign keys, and rollup summaries in relational databases. Architectural mistakes early on cause sync errors and make scaling your business operations nearly impossible. Airtable Cobuilder builds optimized relational schemas, connects entity relationships, and styles front-end dashboards in seconds. You launch custom enterprise apps instantly.",
